Package: gluco
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Gluco contributors <gluco@localhost>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: fonts-inter
Description: Desktop window for LibreLinkUp glucose
 Gluco keeps a LibreLinkUp glucose reading on the desktop: the current
 value, trend, recent history, and how long the sensor has left.
 .
 Gluco is not made by Abbott and it is not a medical device. Readings
 can be delayed or missing. Dose and treat from the FreeStyle Libre app
 or reader.
